,224.65231323242188],"lines":[{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,107.09646606445312,531.3027954101562,117.05408477783203],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"also about research grant opportunities, and library catalogues and so forth; Professional support staff wanting","size":9.95761775970459,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,118.97431182861328,532.00537109375,129.03604125976562],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"to access data repositories associated to HR and Finance functions, along again with policies and procedures;","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,131.07888793945312,531.3048706054688,140.9413604736328],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"Students needing to find and access information about courses, scholarships, fee payments, events, etc. In a typical","size":9.862470626831055,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,143.01498413085938,531.2975463867188,152.902587890625],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"organisation of the size of a university, this information does not reside on a unique information system: instead","size":9.887598037719727,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,154.8393096923828,532.4016723632812,164.90103149414062],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"it is spread across several resources: from internal websites (some publicly facing too), to library catalogues,","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,166.94387817382812,531.5588989257812,176.8063507080078],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"e-learning systems, shared cloud space solutions (e.g., Microsoft’s Sharepoint and Teams), databases, among many","size":9.862470626831055,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,178.33094787597656,531.300537109375,188.81106567382812],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"other data management solutions. While this problem of","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" information scattering","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":6},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"[","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"1","size":9.962599754333496,"flags":4},{"text":"] is even more exacerbated","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,190.70533752441406,531.3042602539062,200.76705932617188],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"in larger organisations, we are increasingly witnessing information scattering affecting also individuals with","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,202.7571563720703,531.3052368164062,212.6898193359375],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"their personal files and information spread across multiple information services (multiple email accounts, cloud","size":9.932666778564453,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,214.68971252441406,333.1891174316406,224.65231323242188],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"storage providers, multimedia management applications, etc.).","size":9.962599754333496,"flags":4}]}]},{"type":0,"bbox":[80.21900177001953,226.63351440429688,532.8375244140625,368.11431884765625],"lines":[{"bbox":[90.66000366210938,226.63351440429688,531.2988891601562,236.61105346679688],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"Federated search attempts to address information scattering by providing a search engine technology that is","size":9.977532386779785,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,238.5364532470703,531.305908203125,248.5833740234375],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"able to gather information from multiple resources, and assemble this information into a unique set of search","size":10.046924591064453,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,250.4803009033203,531.3041381835938,260.5420227050781],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"results. Federated search has had extensive attention in the early 2000s, where the focus was to create meta","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.21900177001953,262.4994812011719,531.297607421875,272.4770202636719],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"Web search engines, that federated separate search engines available on the Web [","size":9.977532386779785,"flags":4},{"text":"10","size":9.962599754333496,"flags":4},{"text":",","size":9.977532386779785,"flags":4},{"text":" 11","size":9.962599754333496,"flags":4},{"text":",","size":9.977532386779785,"flags":4},{"text":" 33","size":9.962599754333496,"flags":4},{"text":"]; but this attention","size":9.977532386779785,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,274.39129638671875,531.3040771484375,284.4530334472656],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"has largely lessened since. We believe that the recent, rapid increasing development and uptake of Retrieval","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.3489990234375,286.45068359375,531.3056030273438,296.37335205078125],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"Augmented Generation (RAG) pipelines, especially in the context of language-based information agents such as","size":9.92266845703125,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,298.45086669921875,532.8375244140625,308.3133239746094],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"chatbots, will provide new impetus in research on federated search, especially in the context of such RAG pipelines.","size":9.862470626831055,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.21900177001953,310.2563171386719,531.303955078125,320.31805419921875],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"We show an example of such a RAG pipeline in Figure 1. Here, a user utterance that has been identified as a","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,322.3006896972656,532.8367309570312,332.24334716796875],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"request for information is forwarded to information resources so as to trigger a search for relevant information.","size":9.942654609680176,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,334.3130798339844,531.3053588867188,344.1805725097656],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"Retrieved information is then returned to the agent, which uses a Large Language Model (LLM) to aggregate and","size":9.867501258850098,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,346.2718811035156,531.3046875,356.13433837890625],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"synthesise the search results, and generate a response for the user. Example of RAG pipelines that implement this","size":9.862470626831055,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,358.1517028808594,358.1155700683594,368.11431884765625],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"are langchain [5], llamaindex [25], and DSPy [19, 20], among others.","size":9.962599754333496,"flags":4}]}]},{"type":0,"bbox":[80.39900207519531,370.0731506347656,532.8382568359375,523.5313110351562],"lines":[{"bbox":[90.66000366210938,370.0731506347656,531.3007202148438,380.08050537109375],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"Key tasks in federated search are (a) resource selection, which refers to the selection of a subset of available","size":10.007330894470215,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,381.9873046875,531.3041381835938,392.0490417480469],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"resources to which forward the search request, and (b) result merging, which refers to the aggregation of the","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,393.9422912597656,531.3043823242188,404.0040283203125],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"search","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"result","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"lists","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"retrieved","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"from","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"each","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"resource","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"into","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"a","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"unique","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"list","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"of","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"results","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"to","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"be","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"passed","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"onto","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"the","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"response","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,406.0252685546875,531.5585327148438,415.9178771972656],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"generation process. If multiple resources are to be searched, some of the current RAG pipelines typically employ","size":9.89261531829834,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,418.00286865234375,531.3048706054688,427.8653259277344],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"naive approaches such as the round-robin merging of the top k results from all resources. The absence of resource","size":9.862470626831055,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,429.80828857421875,531.3043212890625,439.8700256347656],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"selection","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"strategies","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"have","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"both","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"quality","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"and","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"cost/latency","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"implications.","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"Obtaining","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"information","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"from","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"irrelevant","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,441.83770751953125,532.8382568359375,451.8003234863281],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"resources might increase the chances for LLMs to hallucinate [","size":9.882577896118164,"flags":4},{"text":"8","size":9.962599754333496,"flags":4},{"text":"]. But interacting with all resources available (i.e.","size":9.882577896118164,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,453.86785888671875,532.8377075195312,463.7303161621094],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"performing an individual search on each resource), despite many not being relevant, has many other implications.","size":9.862470626831055,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.39900207519531,465.77392578125,532.3941040039062,475.70159912109375],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"This in fact may attract higher computational and network load, and possible payment of API costs. In addition,","size":9.927669525146484,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,477.77886962890625,531.900390625,487.6413269042969],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"there may be higher latency for the merging process (depending on the complexity of the result merging method)","size":9.862470626831055,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,489.63629150390625,531.3030395507812,499.6287536621094],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"and information aggregation/answer generation (assuming that the LLM responsible for this needs to perform","size":9.992443084716797,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,501.55413818359375,531.298095703125,511.59613037109375],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"inferences for each of the retrieved results). Similarly, the absence of effective result merging approaches also","size":10.041984558105469,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,513.5687255859375,370.1004943847656,523.5313110351562],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"might have implications on the quality of the answers being generated.","size":9.962599754333496,"flags":4}]}]},{"type":0,"bbox":[80.3290023803711,525.5386352539062,532.40185546875,655.0358276367188],"lines":[{"bbox":[90.66000366210938,525.5386352539062,531.2991943359375,535.4813232421875],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"In this paper, we introduce FeB4RAG, a new federated search dataset tailored for integration within the RAG","size":9.942654609680176,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,537.404296875,531.3042602539062,547.466064453125],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"framework.","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"Distinct","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"from","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"existing","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"datasets,","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"FeB4RAG","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"addresses","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"specific","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"limitations","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"previously","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4},{"text":"encountered","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,549.3602905273438,531.3042602539062,559.4220581054688],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"in federated search collections, which we elaborate upon in Section 2. A key innovation in our dataset is the","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,561.4121704101562,531.305419921875,571.3448486328125],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"utilization of advanced LLMs for relevance labelling. We demonstrate that these LLM-generated labels exhibit a","size":9.932666778564453,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,573.3484497070312,531.3026733398438,583.3060913085938],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"high degree of agreement compared to human annotations, thereby ensuring the reliability and applicability of","size":9.95761775970459,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,585.35595703125,531.2975463867188,595.2435913085938],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"our dataset (Section 4). Furthermore, we detail the steps for constructing the FeB4RAG collection (Section 3) and","size":9.887598037719727,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,597.1802978515625,531.3042602539062,607.2420654296875],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"show how to use our collection to evaluate federated search methods and directions for further expansion of","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[80.6969985961914,609.1353149414062,532.40185546875,619.1970825195312],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"the collection (Section 5). Lastly, we show the merits of effective federated search in RAG in Section 6. There,","size":10.061732292175293,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[8